@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Frequently Asked Questions - LinkedLearn";
}

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">Quick answers to common questions about using LinkedLearn.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">How do I register an account?</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600">You can register as a guest using your email address, username, and password. After registering, you will receive a verification code (OTP) via email to verify and activate your account.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">How can I purchase a course?</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600">Browse the course list, select a course you like, and click "Add to Cart". When you are ready, proceed to Checkout where you can safely pay using Stripe. Free courses can be enrolled in instantly without a payment step.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Can I get a refund if I don't like the course?</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600">Yes, you can request a refund for a course transaction within the allowed policy time frame. Platform administrators will review your request and process the refund to your original payment method.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">How do I become an instructor?</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600">Navigate to the "Become An Instructor" page and submit your application, including your profile credentials (CV, title, expertise). Once approved by an admin, your account role will be upgraded to Instructor.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">How do instructors get paid?</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600">Instructors can configure their payout details via Stripe Connect. The platform tracks all course revenue and processes payouts directly to the instructor's linked bank account based on the set schedule.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">What happens if I see inappropriate content?</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600">You can report any course or review for quality issues, copyright violations, or offensive content. Our system uses both human moderation and AI models to ensure a safe learning environment.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
